  "title": "Formalizing Julia in Lean",
  "excerpt": "Julia source code modelled in Lean 4. Each modelled function has a Lean definition following the Julia source. Properties taken from a docstring, the manual, or an invariant are recorded as proven, refuted, or open. A refutation proves the negation of a property in the model; runtime evidence in the associated report establishes whether it is also a Julia bug."
